{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03575",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 4.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.62,
      "end_seconds": 11.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 15.09,
      "end_seconds": 20.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Actually, good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.73,
      "end_seconds": 25.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.84,
      "end_seconds": 37.84,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "Um, you know, so... a painful ulcer that is growing quickly. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.18,
      "end_seconds": 42.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.82,
      "end_seconds": 54.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.3,
      "end_seconds": 75.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, pulse 83, blood pressure 122 over 77, temperature 36.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.39,
      "end_seconds": 80.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.63,
      "end_seconds": 89.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second. When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.78,
      "end_seconds": 101.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "Actually, I'm not sure when it began, to be honest. Some weeks ago, but I can't say how many."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.53,
      "end_seconds": 110.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.67,
      "end_seconds": 138.27,
      "duration_seconds": 26.6,
      "text": "It's once or twice a day. I'd say moderate. I did try to ignore it for a while. Oh, uh, and starting as a pimple. That's been about the same, about four days. Uh, I've had belly cramps and loose stools too, for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.78,
      "end_seconds": 142.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.32,
      "end_seconds": 145.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.39,
      "end_seconds": 147.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.96,
      "end_seconds": 154.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Mm, I've had severe pain too, for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.74,
      "end_seconds": 159.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "And what about fever or recent cut?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.46,
      "end_seconds": 162.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.22,
      "end_seconds": 166.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "And what about diabetes or recent injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.28,
      "end_seconds": 171.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "No, um, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.4,
      "end_seconds": 174.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.94,
      "end_seconds": 178.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.0,
      "end_seconds": 181.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Right, is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.39,
      "end_seconds": 184.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.12,
      "end_seconds": 187.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.2,
      "end_seconds": 201.33,
      "duration_seconds": 13.13,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. No, I share a house with my brother. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.48,
      "end_seconds": 206.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.17,
      "end_seconds": 212.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "So, um, my mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.64,
      "end_seconds": 217.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.77,
      "end_seconds": 220.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "I have thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.05,
      "end_seconds": 227.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.25,
      "end_seconds": 233.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I've, I've had COPD for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.98,
      "end_seconds": 237.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Right, and anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.5,
      "end_seconds": 245.49,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "Right, so thin bones is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.53,
      "end_seconds": 263.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.14,
      "end_seconds": 272.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "I, I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.32,
      "end_seconds": 277.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.44,
      "end_seconds": 283.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Alendronate, 70 milligrams, maybe, once a week for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.61,
      "end_seconds": 289.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.74,
      "end_seconds": 301.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "Right, um, not with me. I'll bring it next time. It's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.07,
      "end_seconds": 305.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.52,
      "end_seconds": 319.22,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.84,
      "end_seconds": 322.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.17,
      "end_seconds": 336.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "The ulcer has a ragged purple edge with a boggy base and undermined borders."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.27,
      "end_seconds": 354.6,
      "duration_seconds": 15.33,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. So, based on the history and the examination, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be possible pyoderma gangrenosum linked to bowel inflammation, or it might be an infected ulcer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.24,
      "end_seconds": 359.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "I mean, uh, will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.44,
      "end_seconds": 372.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.89,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible pyoderma gangrenosum linked to bowel inflammation, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.63,
      "end_seconds": 403.74,
      "duration_seconds": 14.11,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Today I'm not changing anything. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 404.94,
      "end_seconds": 406.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}